# Flight scrape (Argentina → China)

- **No background scrape** unless the user asks (P-refresh, P-all, lotes, etc.).
- **Price cap:** do not write rows with round-trip price **> USD 2.300** (`scripts/price_policy.py`).
- **Sheet columns:** Precio, Origen, Destino, Fecha, Escala IDA/VUELTA, Total Horas, Ida, Vuelta, Cantidad de dias de viaje, Link, Actualizado.
- **MCP:** Google-sheets `write_range` for updates; reads via export CSV or MCP.
- **Pipeline:** `run_flights.cmd` / `scripts/pipeline/*` — steps 1–5; lotes via `pipeline_lotes.py`.
- **CSV mirrors:** `sheet_live.csv`, `sheet_export.csv` — keep in sync after sheet writes when user requests `--update-csv`.
